Below is a sample advertisement for the new diaper product in JSON format. This includes key details such as product name, description, features, and a call to action. Note that you can adjust the details as per your specific product and marketing strategy.

```json
{
  "advertisement": {
    "productName": "ComfortCare Diapers",
    "tagline": "Wrap Your Baby in Comfort",
    "description": "Introducing ComfortCare Diapers, designed with your baby's comfort and happiness in mind. Our innovative design ensures a snug fit without compromising on flexibility, allowing your little one to move freely and playfully.",
    "features": [
      {
        "feature": "Ultra-Soft Materials",
        "description": "Made from the softest materials to ensure your baby's delicate skin stays protected and comfortable."
      },
      {
        "feature": "Breathable Layers",
        "description": "Advanced breathable layers to keep your baby dry and fresh, reducing the risk of skin irritation."
      },
      {
        "feature": "Adjustable Waistband",
        "description": "Easily adjustable waistband for a customizable fit that grows with your baby."
      },
      {
        "feature": "Eco-Friendly",
        "description": "Made with sustainable materials, reducing environmental impact without compromising on quality."
      }
    ],
    "callToAction": {
      "text": "Try ComfortCare Diapers Today!",
      "url": "https://www.comfortcarediapers.com/shop",
      "buttonText": "Shop Now"
    },
    "specialOffer": {
      "text": "Get 20% off your first purchase with code COMFORT20",
      "expirationDate": "2023-12-31"
    },
    "testimonials": [
      {
        "testimonial": "ComfortCare Diapers have been a game-changer for our family. Our baby is so much happier and more comfortable!",
        "name": "Emily R."
      },
      {
        "testimonial": "We were amazed at how well ComfortCare Diapers fit our little one. No more leaks or discomfort!",
        "name": "David K."
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

This JSON structure includes the following sections:

- **productName** and **tagline**: Basic product information.
- **description**: A brief overview of the product's benefits.
- **features**: A list of key features, each with a description.
- **callToAction**: Information to prompt the viewer to take action, including a URL to a shopping page.
- **specialOffer**: Details of any promotional offer, including a discount code and expiration date.
- **testimonials**: Quotes from satisfied customers to build trust and credibility.

You can modify the content and structure as needed to fit your specific marketing strategy and branding.

